---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy" lang="en">
    <article class="post-content">
        <h1>Privacy</h1>
        <p>This is a static file. No database, no backend, no log aggregation. No cookies, no analytics scripts, no user profiling, no A/B testing, no heatmaps, no ads.</p>
        {/* About authorship rather than tracking. The rest of this page is about
            what the site collects from the reader; this is the one promise it
            makes about itself, and it belongs beside the other checkable claims
            rather than on /about, where a bare "none of it by AI" reads as a
            credential next to the more vulnerable line there. */}

        <h2>Writing</h2>
        <p>Every word here was written by me. Nothing on this site was generated, drafted, translated, or edited by an AI system, including the sentences in these pages.</p>
        <h2>Fonts</h2>
        <p>Text is set in Inter, served from this site's own domain as a single self-hosted font file. Because the font is served by us rather than a third party, loading it sends no request to anyone else.</p>
        <h2>Hosting</h2>
        <p>The site is served as static files from Cloudflare Pages. Like any web server, the host may retain request logs such as your IP address and the time of the request.</p>
    </article>
</BaseLayout>
